# M6 mode 3 (own games) with twelve virtual controllers: twelve saves
# (slots 1–3 and the nine extra slots), twelve independent instances side
# by side. Screenshots at 1920x1080 and 640x480; two players solve 0level
# and only their own saves change.
size 1920x1080
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
solve
idle 900
key escape
key down 3
key enter
idle
key down 4
key enter
pads 12
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
pad 3 a
pad 4 a
pad 5 a
pad 6 a
pad 7 a
pad 8 a
pad 9 a
pad 10 a
pad 11 a
pad 12 a
pad 1 up 5
pad 1 right
pad 1 right
expect state join OwnGames players=12
shot 01-join-own-12
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
pad 3 a
pad 4 a
pad 5 a
pad 6 a
pad 7 a
pad 8 a
pad 9 a
pad 10 a
pad 11 a
pad 12 a
wait 50
expect state multi OwnGames players=12 views=12
expect state v11 p12 slot11 baba/0level
wait 30
shot 02-own-12-titlecards
idle
expect same p2 p3
p12 moves RRRR
p7 moves RR
p3 press pause
shot 03-own-12-1080p
size 640x480
shot 04-own-12-640x480
size 1920x1080
p3 press back
p12 solve
p12 idle 900
expect save 11 baba 0level 3
expect save 10 baba 0level -
p7 solve
p7 idle 900
expect save 6 baba 0level 3
expect differ p2 p12
key f2
expect state focus=p1
key f2
key f2
key f2
key f2
key f2
key f2
expect state focus=p7
shot 05-own-12-focus-p7
size 640x480
shot 06-own-12-focus-640x480
size 1920x1080
p1 press pause
p1 press down 3
p1 press wait
idle
expect state title
quit
